<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es"><head><meta charset="utf-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" /><meta name="theme-color" content="#163a31" /><title>@ViewData["Title"] · Aula Nova</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/site.css" asp-append-version="true" /></head>
<body><aside class="sidebar"><a class="brand" asp-controller="Alumno" asp-action="Index"><span class="brand-icon">a<span>n</span></span><span>Aula Nova<small>GESTIÓN ACADÉMICA</small></span></a><div class="nav-label">ESPACIO DE TRABAJO</div><nav aria-label="Navegación principal"><a class="nav-item active" asp-controller="Alumno" asp-action="Index"><span aria-hidden="true">▦</span> Alumnos <span class="nav-dot"></span></a><a class="nav-item" asp-controller="Alumno" asp-action="Create"><span aria-hidden="true">＋</span> Registrar alumno</a></nav><div class="sidebar-card"><span class="sparkle" aria-hidden="true">✳</span><strong>Cada alumno, una historia.</strong><p>Un espacio para acompañar su siguiente paso.</p></div><div class="workspace"><span class="avatar">AN</span><div><strong>Secretaría académica</strong><small>Espacio institucional</small></div></div></aside>
<div class="app-shell"><header class="topbar"><div><span class="breadcrumb-root">Espacio de trabajo</span><span class="crumb-sep">/</span><strong>Alumnos</strong></div><div class="topbar-right"><span class="status-light"></span> Gestión académica <span class="mini-avatar">AN</span></div></header><main id="main-content">@if(TempData["Success"] is string message){<div class="notice" role="status">✓ @message</div>}@RenderBody()</main><footer>Aula Nova <span>Hecho para impulsar el aprendizaje.</span></footer></div><script src="~/js/site.js" asp-append-version="true" defer></script></body></html>
